1.
The error you get is when converting from AD dense matrix to AD sparse matrix. I.e

as(matrix(advector(c(1,0,0,0)),2), "sparseMatrix")

which was not available in RTMB until recently in the development version.

2.
A worked out example on how to use dgmrf is available here:
https://github.com/kaskr/RTMB/blob/master/RTMB/inst/tinytest/test-model-spde.R

